# What this plugin will not do

The page after somebody changed which format the entry promises without the
writer moving with it. The claim is one a reader would act on and the tree does
not keep it.

## It writes one subtitle format

WebVTT, with the `.vtt` extension, and nothing else for the first release.

Held today. Recorded in #35, with the reasoning in `docs/subtitle-format.md`.

## When this list is checked against the code

The closing section, which is about the list rather than a limit in it.
